===Canada===
[[Canada national rugby union team|Canada]] named a 42-man training squad for the tournament on 20 August 2019.<ref>{{cite news |title=Canada return home for last push before Rugby World Cup |url=https://rugby.ca/en/news/2019/08/canada-return-home-for-last-push-before-rugby-world-cup |website=rugby.ca |publisher=Rugby Canada |date=20 August 2019 |access-date=27 August 2019 }}</ref> The final 31-man squad was named on 3 September 2019.<ref>{{cite web |url=https://rugby.ca/en/news/2019/09/rugby-canada-announces-2019-rugby-world-cup-team-final-warm-up-test-match-against-usa-set-to-take-place-september-7th-at-bc-place-stadium |work=[[Rugby Canada]] |title=Rugby Canada announces 2019 Rugby World Cup Team; Final warm-up test match against USA set to take place September 7th at BC Place Stadium |date=3 September 2019 |access-date=3 September 2019}}</ref>

