===France===
On 18 June 2019, head coach [[Jacques Brunel (rugby union)|Jacques Brunel]] named a 37-man squad for the [[2019 Rugby World Cup warm-up matches]].<ref>{{cite news |title=Brunel names France squad to prepare for RWC 2019 |url=https://www.rugbyworldcup.com/news/431411 |website=rugbyworldcup.com |publisher=Rugby World Cup |date=18 June 2019 |access-date=27 August 2019 }}</ref> On 10 July 2019, [[Paul Willemse]] had to withdraw from the team due to injury; he was replaced by [[Romain Taofifénua]].<ref>{{cite news |first=Sylvain |last=Muzeau |title=Romain Taofifenua remplace Paul Willemse pour préparer la Coupe du monde |url=https://www.ffr.fr/actualites/xv-de-france/forfait-de-paul-willemse-pour-la-preparation-de-la-coupe-du-monde |website=ffr.fr |publisher=French Rugby Federation |date=10 July 2019 |access-date=27 August 2019 }}</ref> On 20 July 2019, [[Cyril Baille]] was called up to replace the injured [[Étienne Falgoux]].<ref>{{cite news |first=Sylvain |last=Muzeau |title=Cyril Baille remplace Etienne Falgoux |url=https://www.ffr.fr/actualites/xv-de-france/cyril-baille-remplace-etienne-falgoux |website=ffr.fr |publisher=French Rugby Federation |date=20 July 2019 |access-date=27 August 2019 }}</ref>

[[France national rugby union team|France]] named their final 31-man squad for the tournament on 2 September 2019.<ref>{{cite news |first=Sylvain |last=Muzeau |title=Le groupe pour la Coupe du monde |url=https://www.ffr.fr/actualites/xv-de-france/le-groupe-pour-la-coupe-du-monde |website=ffr.fr |publisher=French Rugby Federation |date=2 September 2019 |access-date=3 September 2019 }}</ref>

<sup>1</sup> On 22 September, [[Wesley Fofana (rugby union)|Wesley Fofana]] withdrew from the squad due to injury, and was replaced by [[Pierre-Louis Barassi]].<ref>{{cite news |title=THE END OF A DREAM FOR FRANCE CENTRE FOFANA |url=https://www.rugbyworldcup.com/news/476829 |website=Rugby World Cup |publisher=Rugby World Cup |date=22 September 2019 |access-date=22 September 2019 }}</ref>

<sup>2</sup> On 29 September, [[Cedate Gomes Sa]] was called up to replace the injured [[Demba Bamba]].<ref>{{cite news |title=Coupe du monde : Gomes Sa en renfort ! |url=https://www.ffr.fr/actualites/xv-de-france/coupe-du-monde-gomes-sa-en-renfort |website=ffr.fr |publisher=French Rugby Federation |date=29 September 2019 |access-date=25 October 2019}}</ref>

<sup>3</sup> On 4 October, [[Christopher Tolofua]] was called up to replace the injured [[Peato Mauvaka]].<ref name="Mauvaka and Rattez called up">{{cite news |title=Coupe du monde de rugby : Ramos et Mauvaka forfaits |url=https://www.ffr.fr/actualites/xv-de-france/forfait-thomas-ramos-peato-mauvaka |website=ffr.fr |publisher=French Rugby Federation |date=4 October 2019 |access-date=25 October 2019}}</ref>

