===United States===
On 13 June, the [[United States national rugby union team|United States]] named a 50-man extended training squad ahead of the [[2019 World Rugby Pacific Nations Cup]] in preparation for the 2019 Rugby World Cup.<ref>{{cite news |first=Aalina |last=Tabani |title=USA Men's Eagles name preliminary training squad for Rugby World Cup Japan 2019 |url=https://www.usa.rugby/2019/06/usa-mens-eagles-name-preliminary-training-squad-for-rugby-world-cup-japan-2019/ |website=usa.rugby |publisher=USA Rugby |date=13 June 2019 |access-date=3 September 2019 }}</ref> On 19 June, [[Samu Manoa]] retired from international rugby and withdrew from the squad.<ref>{{cite news |first=Aalina |last=Tabani |title=Men's Eagle Samu Manoa retires from international rugby |url=https://www.usa.rugby/2019/06/mens-eagle-samu-manoa-retires-from-international-rugby/ |website=usa.rugby |publisher=USA Rugby |date=18 June 2019 |access-date=3 September 2019 }}</ref>

On 8 September, USA were the last side to name their 31-man squad.<ref>{{cite news|url=http://www.usa.rugby/2019/09/usa-mens-national-team-announce-31-player-squad-for-rugby-world-cup-japan-2019/|work=USA Rugby|date=8 September 2019|access-date=8 September 2019|title=USA Men's National Team announce 31 player squad for Rugby World Cup Japan 2019}}</ref>

